# Awoof Academic Profile Retention Purge Cron Template
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STATUS: DISABLED PENDING OWNER/LEGAL APPROVAL AND RETENTION WINDOW AUTHORIZATION
#
# PURPOSE:
# Daily scheduled execution of the academic profile data cleanup script to purge
# academic profiles belonging to soft-deleted accounts whose deletion occurred
# at or before the approved retention cutoff (ACADEMIC_PROFILE_RETENTION_DAYS).
#
# PREREQUISITES BEFORE ACTIVATION:
# 1. Legal and management authorization of ACADEMIC_PROFILE_RETENTION_DAYS (e.g. 30).
# 2. ACADEMIC_PROFILE_RETENTION_DAYS set in production environment (.env / systemd).
# 3. Migration 088 applied (providing academic_profile_deletion_ledger and generation_id).
# 4. Host directory /var/backups/awoof or repo-relative backups/ exists with 0700 permissions.
#
# HOSTINGER VPS INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS:
# Option A (crontab for deploy/node user):
#   crontab -e
#   Add the line below (uncommented):
#   30 3 * * * /usr/bin/node /home/deploy/awoof/apps/backend/dist/scripts/cleanup-academic-profile-data.js --batch-size 500 >> /var/log/awoof/academic-profile-purge.log 2>&1
#
# Option B (/etc/cron.d/awoof-academic-profile-purge):
#   30 3 * * * deploy cd /home/deploy/awoof/apps/backend && /usr/bin/node dist/scripts/cleanup-academic-profile-data.js --batch-size 500 >> /var/log/awoof/academic-profile-purge.log 2>&1
#
# CONCURRENCY AND RESILIENCE:
# - Script acquires PostgreSQL session advisory lock (2026101801) on a dedicated connection.
#   If a prior run is still in progress, the overlapping run exits cleanly without error.
# - Deletions are processed in batches (default 500) and recorded in the dual deletion ledger.
# - Outputs counts/outcomes only; never logs PII, emails, or personal identifiers.
#
# # TEMPLATE LINE (Uncomment and set correct paths upon activation):
# 30 3 * * * cd /var/www/awoof/apps/backend && npm run academic-profile:purge:prod -- --batch-size 500 >> /var/log/awoof/academic-profile-purge.log 2>&1
